host_about:
 I am a fun loving easy going person.  ... I believe in morals and good manners.  The simplest things in life make me happy.  I love to travel, read books, attend plays and listen to music. The five things that I can not live without is: God-Family/Friends, Love, Ice, Central Air, and New Orleans food..:}

My life Motto is
Un to thy self be true............

